flowchart TB
  accTitle: Readiness and reuse protect different hazards
  accDescr: A shared buffer can be filled only after its previous consumer is finished. A consumer can read only after transfer completion. More work cycles through reuse; loop exit drains outstanding computation before results are used.
  A["Consumer complete"] --> B["Transfer; await ready"]
  B --> C["Consume tile"]
  C --> D["More tiles?"]
  D -->|"Yes: await consumer"| A
  D -->|"No"| E["Drain; use results"]
